 troubleshooting=[('Something not working?','Restart the game and check for an app and system update. On iPad, try both orientations. Include your device model when reporting a layout issue.'),('Something not working?','Restart the game and check for an app and Android update. If controls feel wrong, check your control settings before starting another attempt.'),('Remote not responding?','Check that the remote is paired and charged. Tell us your Apple TV model, tvOS version and whether the issue affects swipes, buttons or both.'),('Focus or controls stuck?','Check your remote connection, then restart the app. Tell us the TV or streaming-device model, Android TV version and the screen where it happens.')],
