 faqs=[('How do I unlock Classic and Endless?','Earn stars across the game. Classic unlocks at 30 stars and Endless at 60. In World Tour, complete available levels to open the next stop.'),('What’s different about the three modes?','World Tour reveals landmarks as you capture territory. Classic is a 20-stage retro adventure. Endless generates a new challenge each stage and records your best run.'),('Can I play without an internet connection?','Core gameplay works offline. Online features such as platform rankings, achievements and ads, where enabled, need an internet connection.'),('Where is my progress saved?','Progress is stored on your device. Do not delete the app or clear its data while troubleshooting: you may lose your save. Game Center or Play Games sign-in alone does not mean that cloud saves are enabled.'),('Why do features differ between devices?','Touchscreens and TVs have different controls and settings. Notification reminders are for supported mobile devices. Android builds may show ads where enabled; iPhone, iPad and Apple TV builds do not.'),('How do I change privacy choices?','Open Settings in the game to manage optional diagnostics and, where available, advertising preferences. Manage notification permission in your device settings. See the Privacy Policy for details.'),('The game crashed or something looks wrong. What now?','Reopen the game and check for updates. If it happens again, send us the platform, device model, system and game versions, and the steps that caused it. A screenshot or short recording helps; please hide personal information.')],
